    "S4",
    "S5",
    "S6",
    "S7",
    "S8",
    "S9"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The clean references are controlled static recreations and not captures of the running storefront.",
    "Illustrative product names, cards, counts, and selected facet values are not live catalog data.",
    "Motion distance and duration are proposed because the source defines no animation values.",
    "The static references use a local Tahoma fallback; the application prefers Vazirmatn when available."
  ],
